### Architecture Mapping

| Android (Kotlin) | Flutter (Dart) |
|-------------------|----------------|
| ViewModel + LiveData | ChangeNotifier + Provider |
| NavHost + Activities | GoRouter + ShellRoute |
| EncryptedSharedPreferences | FlutterSecureStorage |
| SharedPreferences | shared_preferences |
| OkHttp | http package |
| Gson | json_serializable / dart:convert |
| Jetpack Compose | Flutter widgets |
| Material 3 (Compose) | Material 3 (Flutter) |
| Canvas (Compose) | CustomPainter |
| Coil | Image.network / cached_network_image |
| Markwon | flutter_markdown |

### Design System: Neo-Editorial

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Border radius | 0 (sharp corners everywhere) |
| Card borders | 1dp subtle grey |
| Primary (Light/Dark) | #FF4500 International Orange |
| Primary (Deep Blue) | #3B82F6 Electric Blue |
| Input font | JetBrains Mono (monospace) |
| Body font | Inter (sans-serif) |
| Haptic | Light tap on selection, medium on confirm |
| Animations | Spring physics (MediumBouncy), 200ms color transitions |